<main class="api-key-page"><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Chatbot</p><h1>Eigene Commands</h1><p>Eigene Commands funktionieren auf allen verknüpften Plattformen.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Custom Command anlegen oder aktualisieren</h2><form method="POST" action="/Commands/Custom"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{data.csrf_token}}"><label>Name ohne Prefix <input name="name" maxlength="32" pattern="[a-z0-9_]+" required></label><label>Beschreibung <input name="description" maxlength="255"></label><label>Antwort <textarea name="response_template" maxlength="400" required></textarea></label><button class="button primary">Speichern</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Deine Commands</h2>{{#each data.user_commands}}<article><code>!{{name}}</code> — {{response_template}} <form method="POST" action="/Commands/Custom/{{id}}/Delete"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{../data.csrf_token}}"><button class="button danger">Löschen</button></form></article>{{else}}<p class="muted">Noch keine eigenen Commands.</p>{{/each}}</section><section class="card" style="opacity:.55"><h2>Globale Commands</h2><p class="muted">Diese Commands werden von der Administration verwaltet und können nicht überschrieben werden.</p>{{#each data.global_commands}}<article><code>!{{name}}</code> — {{response_template}}</article>{{else}}<p>Derzeit keine globalen Datenbank-Commands.</p>{{/each}}</section><section class="card"><h2>Zugangspunkt-Einstellungen</h2>{{#each data.endpoints}}<form method="POST" action="/Commands/Endpoints"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{../data.csrf_token}}"><input type="hidden" name="service" value="{{service}}"><input type="hidden" name="endpoint_id" value="{{endpoint_id}}"><strong>{{service}}: {{name}}</strong> <label>Prefix <input name="prefix" value="{{prefix}}" maxlength="10" required></label><input type="hidden" name="commands_enabled" value="0"><label><input type="checkbox" name="commands_enabled" value="1" {{#if commands_enabled}}checked{{/if}}> Aktiv</label><button class="button">Speichern</button></form>{{else}}<p class="muted">Keine Zugangspunkte.</p>{{/each}}</section></main>
